                "text_YGeTr6": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Noritamy is an award winning brand that creates handcrafted jewelry and accessories , drawing  inspiration from the realms of art, architecture, and sculpture.<br/>This unique blend of inspirations brings a modern twist to classic designs, with collections that embody the eternal debate between these two trades, resulting in dramatic and refined pieces.</p><p>The brand , initially launched 18 years ago as a creative fusion of two accomplished women, Nori and Tamy.<br/>Nori, a former trained interior architect with a <strong>B.des degree</strong> and Tamy, an artist with a background in jewelry making, synergize their knowledge and experience to create timeless luxury pieces with a contemporary and fashionable  feminine flair.</p><p>Originally launched in the Middle East Noritamy rapidly gained global recognition after participating in LFW designer showrooms.<br/>Over the past 5 years, Nori has taken sole lead of the brand, expanding its reach into consulting, fashion design, and the creation of home and art pieces, with an emphasis on collaborations.</p><p>Noritamy’s excellence has been celebrated in high-fashion magazines worldwide, including <strong>UK/Paris/Italian VOGUE, Harper’s Bazaar, BOF, Elle, Marie Claire, Interview</strong>, <strong>WGSN, SWAROVSKI BOOK OF INSPIRATIONS</strong> .</p><p>Nori was recently awarded <strong>“Best sculpture oriented jewelry designer, in the middle east” </strong>by Lux magazine.</p><p>Noritamy is coveted in Europe, Asia, and the Middle East, admired for its wide range of fashion-oriented statement pieces and delicate high-end gold and diamond creations.</p><p>Top stylists and bloggers globally have been captivated by the jewelry, which have graced the likes of celebrities such as</p><p><strong>Marta Pozan,Caylee Cowen,Victor Perez, Nicole Scherzinger</strong>, <strong>Eugen Lee Yang</strong>, <strong>FKA twigs</strong>, <strong>Alesha Dixon</strong>, <strong>Alena Watson</strong>,  <strong>Clara Amfo</strong>, and more.</p><p>Each season, our creative director unveils a new collection,  accompanied by a unique and inspiring story that fuels her creativity.<br/>The ability to blend art, architecture, and fashion continues to enchant the fashion world, and makes Noritamy a prominent and celebrated name in the industry.</p><p>“<em>Our fashion jewelry is hand made in our studio. For that reason no two pieces are exactly alike and in a world of mass market and fast fashion we are very proud of that. All jewelry is dipped in a heavy layer of 24K gold or silver tone, and its all nickel free. We have premium lines and we work with clients to develop custom made pieces upon request.”</em></p><p><em>We welcome you to explore Noritamy’s various collections and visit our studio to get a glimpse on how we create the jewelry”.</em></p><p> </p><p><strong>For any inquiries please contact us at : </strong><a href=\"mailto:info@noritamy.com\"><strong>info@noritamy.com</strong></a></p>",
                    "width": "100%",
